# GitHub push from this host

See `/home/ubuntu/fortress-ai/scripts/setup_github_push.sh` and `/home/ubuntu/fortress-ai/.cursor/rules/github-push.mdc` for the shared VM setup.

**trading-bot** default branch: `master`. **fortress-ai** default branch: `main`.

```bash
cd /home/ubuntu/trading-bot && git push origin master
```

Do not commit `.env`. Run `./scripts/e2e_before_deploy.sh` before push when code changed.
